        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT-DESCRIPTION" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The show around the Tithe: the Mirrormaster and the crowd of Aurum, watching through the Seeing Mirrors. It turns kills, defeated rivals and new depths into Renown, rewards kill streaks with sponsor gifts, punishes boredom with beasts and seals depths to drive the candidates down." vertex="1">
